This product includes data and services from:

- Global Weather & EAS Society (GWES) Central Alert Repository
  https://alerts.globaleas.org
  https://alerts.globaleas.org/swagger/
  Public API, no key required. Used under their public terms.

- National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration (NOAA)
  CAP feeds via https://alerts.weather.gov and https://api.weather.gov
  Public domain U.S. government works.

Requests to these services include a descriptive User-Agent identifying this project
(EASRepository/1.0 + repository URL).
